        "body": "<img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiF2-4cBXmovfUIIthoMQHq-YMz-eRHtl_lei6RxDaOSBY4HEM1467l3EQ1pLKjLAb2LH4ypm6ScaI1CFqoFVC1nkqHDk_rCIJ-htfQTMAmbXz4W4jo_IbdnXNnBcMhXgh59aixJg/s320/My+HipstaPrint+868725441-793605.jpg\"  border=\"0\" alt=\"\" id=\"BLOGGER_PHOTO_ID_5743179995607192674\" />\nIt's a rare thing for me to open a CD. So when I do, it's special. Complimenting this occasion is multiple other factors; that this CD is a result of my friend's toil is the biggest of all. Add the fact that this has to be the most legit looking CD, and you have one happy listener. \n\n\n\nLens: Loftus\n\nFilm: DC"
