        "file": "2007-06-30-Paul-Bunyan-s-iPhone.md",
        "year": "2007",
        "date": "June 30, 2007",
        "title": "Paul Bunyan's iPhone",
        "body": "<img src=\"http://photos1.blogger.com/x/blogger2/4201/1199/320/z/394080/img074-728041.jpg\" width=\"320\"/>\nApparently he's looking for a Starbucks.  Question: do you really need a $600 phone to find a Starbucks?  I'd much rather just look out any open window.It's fun blogging from enemy territory.  I've been asked 3 times whether I've needed any help.  No, I'm fine.I'll see if I can't get a hold of the legendary phone here in a minute.  The crowd; she is huge, captain.\nPosted wirelessly, from Chandler Mall."
