        "body": "For the first time I saw the work of heaven,\n\nThe shape of our future,\n\nThe shape of all our history...\n\n\n\n\n\n\nI know it's true\n\nIt's written in a sky as blue\n\nAs blue as your eyes, \n\nAs blue as your eyes...\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSting, I Was Brought to my Senses"
